        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Furthermore, through our significant presence in the largest hubs in South America —Santiago, Lima and São Paulo— we believe that we are able to offer the best connectivity options between South America and the rest of the world.",
